# Purging the edge cache after a write. Optional: without them the pages
# still expire on their own (see `heyo-cms.cache.ts`), they are just not
# emptied the moment somebody presses publish.
#
# The token needs one permission — Zone / Cache Purge — on this zone only.
# In production set it as a Worker secret instead of a file:
#   wrangler secret put CLOUDFLARE_PURGE_TOKEN
# CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=...
# CLOUDFLARE_PURGE_TOKEN=...
